  },
  {
   "id": "e162",
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "seed": 162,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 162,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": [],
   "locked": false,
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1542,
   "y": 180,
   "width": 426,
   "height": 150.0,
   "text": "The client reference is a hash of the thread and the\napproved pack. It is also the Idempotency-Key, so the\npayer returns the same claim for the same key.\nBefore every send, and after any unclear failure, the\npayer is asked whether it already holds the reference.\nIf that lookup fails too: status unconfirmed. Nothing\nis resent blind; M1 repeats the lookup on every open\nand adopts the claim when it appears.\nVerified live: one claim at the payer after a dropped\nanswer and a double click (V-10, V-09, V-31).",
   "originalText": "The client reference is a hash of the thread and the\napproved pack. It is also the Idempotency-Key, so the\npayer returns the same claim for the same key.\nBefore every send, and after any unclear failure, the\npayer is asked whether it already holds the reference.\nIf that lookup fails too: status unconfirmed. Nothing\nis resent blind; M1 repeats the lookup on every open\nand adopts the claim when it appears.\nVerified live: one claim at the payer after a dropped\nanswer and a double click (V-10, V-09, V-31).",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "e163",
   "strokeColor": "#868e96",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
